#: src/Admin/Notices.php:146
msgid "The value of %s in your wp-config.php file is invalid and has been ignored. Please correct it, otherwise your Google Tag Manager container will not use the setting you configured there."
msgid_plural "The values of %s in your wp-config.php file are invalid and have been ignored. Please correct them, otherwise your Google Tag Manager container will not use the settings you configured there."
